// An option's text can't pause or run commands.

== fixture.option_text
-> Wait {w} here
//      ^^^ PIB1016
-> Pause {w 0.5} here
//       ^^^^^^^ PIB1016
-> A new page{p}
//           ^^^ PIB1016
-> Jolt {@jolt mira}
//      ^^^^^^^^^^^^ PIB1016
-> {if $a}Wait{w}{/if}
//            ^^^ PIB1016

// Must not trigger

-> [b]Bold[/b] {$name} {icon interact} {if $a}yes{/if}{br}line two
mira: Text lines can {w} pause{p} and {@jolt mira} run commands.
